(7498129, 1194718, 19825, '<td valign="top">The composition is pretty good, but I would likely have a stronger connection with the image if I could see a face in this lifestyle portrait.</td>', 'The composition is pretty good, but I would likely have a stronger connection with the image if I could see a face in this lifestyle portrait.', '2017-02-10 09:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(7498130, 1195033, 19825, '<td valign="top">A colorful and interesting subject. Next time you might try a less static pose, catch a moment when the subject is a bit more actively engaged, and/or consider pulling back to provide more context on the lifestyle.</td>', 'A colorful and interesting subject. Next time you might try a less static pose, catch a moment when the subject is a bit more actively engaged, and/or consider pulling back to provide more context on the lifestyle.', '2017-02-10 09:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
