(7498207, 1195004, 185757, '<td valign="top">There''s something about this image that I really like. Perhaps it''s the flowing beard which adds an edge to an otherwise very clean cut and dapper looking biker on his high-end machine. <br/> <br/>I think I would have liked it even better if you had used a panning technique to introduce the illusion of speed.</td>', 'There''s something about this image that I really like. Perhaps it''s the flowing beard which adds an edge to an otherwise very clean cut and dapper looking biker on his high-end machine.  I think I would have liked it even better if you had used a panning technique to introduce the illusion of speed.', '2017-02-10 17:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
