(7499627, 1194816, 157179, '<td valign="top">This is my favourite image. I love the composition. Would have been nice to see the subject doing something like holding plans or sweeping with a broom or looking through a theodolite or just holding something up to his face to give the idea that he is busy doing something as opposed to just standing there. Still my favourite.</td>', 'This is my favourite image. I love the composition. Would have been nice to see the subject doing something like holding plans or sweeping with a broom or looking through a theodolite or just holding something up to his face to give the idea that he is busy doing something as opposed to just standing there. Still my favourite.', '2017-02-15 10:52:08.000000', NULL, 1),
