(7500344, 1195064, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image the fulfils the challenge brief<br/> <br/>Quite a straightforward portrait, nicely off-centre and his eyes looking at the camera help to engage the viewer. I find the bright lights in the background very distracting, they are competing with the person for attention. The overall softness and tone adds appeal to the overall effect.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image the fulfils the challenge brief Quite a straightforward portrait, nicely off-centre and his eyes looking at the camera help to engage the viewer. I find the bright lights in the background very distracting, they are competing with the person for attention. The overall softness and tone adds appeal to the overall effect.', '2017-02-17 05:44:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(7500345, 1195011, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image the fulfils the challenge brief<br/> <br/>Well Marcel youve certainly captured the action here, it must have been an impressive show. This is a purely personal gripe but I would have preferred a slower shutter speed to show some motion blur. The composition could have been improved too the rider looks as though he is going to crash into the building. Sorry, I cant be more positive about it but nice to see your commenters are certainly happy with it.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image the fulfils the challenge brief Well Marcel youve certainly captured the action here, it must have been an impressive show. This is a purely personal gripe but I would have preferred a slower shutter speed to show some motion blur. The composition could have been improved too the rider looks as though he is going to crash into the building. Sorry, I cant be more positive about it but nice to see your commenters are certainly happy with it.', '2017-02-17 05:50:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(7500347, 1195063, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image the fulfils the challenge brief<br/> <br/>This is a pleasing portrait Janine, Im surprised it didnt do better. The boys smile is engaging and his movement towards the camera is all helping to draw the viewer in. The background is a nice natural scene and the snow has some nice whites without losing detail so the exposure is good too.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image the fulfils the challenge brief This is a pleasing portrait Janine, Im surprised it didnt do better. The boys smile is engaging and his movement towards the camera is all helping to draw the viewer in. The background is a nice natural scene and the snow has some nice whites without losing detail so the exposure is good too.', '2017-02-17 05:53:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(7500348, 1195022, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An interesting image the fulfils the challenge brief<br/> <br/>You have an unfair advantage Eugene with the ice queen for your model! Another lovely portrait, nicely positioned with her expression and eyes she pulls you in. As you rightly say this is a lovely lens with sufficient background detail to show that she is in an interesting location without the background becoming too distracting. I think I might have been tempted to tilt the camera down a touch to reduce the sky above her head but its not a big deal.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An interesting image the fulfils the challenge brief You have an unfair advantage Eugene with the ice queen for your model! Another lovely portrait, nicely positioned with her expression and eyes she pulls you in. As you rightly say this is a lovely lens with sufficient background detail to show that she is in an interesting location without the background becoming too distracting. I think I might have been tempted to tilt the camera down a touch to reduce the sky above her head but its not a big deal.', '2017-02-17 06:00:24.000000', NULL, 0),
